507
00:48:29,493 --> 00:48:32,204
I 'm now gonna ask that you keep an open mind

508
00:48:32,412 --> 00:48:35,666
to what our evidence and testimony will show .

509
00:48:35,874 --> 00:48:38,794
Medical treatment was not the answer for Emily

510
00:48:39,002 --> 00:48:42,631
because she simply did not suffer from a medical condition .

511
00:48:42,840 --> 00:48:47,344
She was neither epileptic nor psychotic .

512
00:48:50,180 --> 00:48:53,809
Emily Rose 's condition , in fact , was demonic possession .

513
00:48:54,017 --> 00:48:57,479
An exorcism was her only hope for a cure .

514
00:48:57,688 --> 00:49:01,650
Some of you may find yourself unable to reconcile Emily 's beliefs

515
00:49:01,859 --> 00:49:04,152
or those of the defendant with your own .

516
00:49:04,361 --> 00:49:08,490
You may not believe demons exist . You won 't have to .

517
00:49:08,991 --> 00:49:12,494
Because you will see that after the utter failure of doctors to help Emily

518
00:49:13,287 --> 00:49:16,707
Father Moore simply tried to help Emily in a different way

519
00:49:16,915 --> 00:49:22,462
using an approach that he , Emily and her family firmly believed

520
00:49:22,671 --> 00:49:24,840
was her only chance for relief .

521
00:49:25,048 --> 00:49:27,676
And we will show that despite his greatest efforts

522
00:49:27,885 --> 00:49:30,012
and his sincere love for Emily

523
00:49:31,555 --> 00:49:36,351
there was nothing he could 've done to prevent the death of Emily Rose .

524
00:49:39,730 --> 00:49:41,523
Are you okay ?

525
00:49:42,900 --> 00:49:44,359
Aren 't you gonna eat anything ?

526
00:50:17,851 --> 00:50:22,147
She said it was terrible to hear the clinking of spoons and forks .

527
00:50:22,648 --> 00:50:25,484
She was always hungry , but she said they wouldn 't let her eat .

528
00:50:26,777 --> 00:50:28,904
Who did she mean by " they " ?

529
00:50:29,863 --> 00:50:32,741
The forces that were in control of her .

530
00:50:32,950 --> 00:50:35,244
That were inside her .

531
00:50:36,828 --> 00:50:38,330
You know , the demons .

532
00:50:40,457 --> 00:50:42,584
Tell us what else happened that night .

533
00:50:46,630 --> 00:50:49,091
I walked her back to her dorm

534
00:50:49,758 --> 00:50:52,511
and she seemed really nervous and scared .

535
00:50:52,719 --> 00:50:56,515
So I held her for a while , trying to calm her down .

536
00:50:56,723 --> 00:51:02,187
I fell asleep , but when I woke up , she wasn 't beside me .

537
00:51:15,242 --> 00:51:16,785
Emily ?

538
00:51:29,006 --> 00:51:30,507
Hey .

539
00:51:34,636 --> 00:51:36,555
Can you hear me ?

540
00:51:48,567 --> 00:51:51,153
I called her father , and he told me to bring Emily home .

541
00:51:53,780 --> 00:51:56,033
Jason and I put Emily to bed

542
00:51:56,241 --> 00:51:58,410
hoping she would sleep .

543
00:51:58,619 --> 00:52:00,579
And when did Father Moore become involved ?

544
00:52:02,414 --> 00:52:04,458
Emily stayed home after that .

545
00:52:04,666 --> 00:52:08,754
She didn 't return to school , and she kept getting worse .

546
00:52:08,962 --> 00:52:13,592
Eventually , when she didn 't get better , we called our priest , Father Moore .

547
00:52:14,426 --> 00:52:16,970
When he arrived , I sent my daughter Alice upstairs

548
00:52:17,221 --> 00:52:19,556
to see if Emily was awake .

549
00:52:29,066 --> 00:52:30,359
Emily ?

550
00:52:33,612 --> 00:52:35,531
Can I come in ?

551
00:52:49,711 --> 00:52:52,840
- Our Father , who art in heaven ... - Emily ?

552
00:52:57,219 --> 00:52:59,888
Father Moore is here . Can you come downstairs ?

553
00:53:00,097 --> 00:53:02,266
- As it is in heaven .

554
00:53:02,474 --> 00:53:05,853
Give us this day our daily bread ...

555
00:53:54,443 --> 00:53:55,694
Emily , can you hear me ?

556
00:54:11,835 --> 00:54:13,170
Let 's get her off the floor .

557
00:54:14,546 --> 00:54:15,631
Alice , no !

558
00:54:28,644 --> 00:54:31,647
I am the one who dwells within .

559
00:54:33,899 --> 00:54:37,986
And I am the one who comes in His name .

560
00:54:39,905 --> 00:54:43,575
Think you can force me out , priest ?

561
00:54:44,785 --> 00:54:45,953
Try .

562
00:54:48,205 --> 00:54:49,831
I dare you .

563
00:55:51,643 --> 00:55:54,771
You 've suffered a terrible loss , Mr. Rose . I know this is difficult .

564
00:55:54,980 --> 00:55:57,357
So thank you for being here today .

565
00:55:57,566 --> 00:55:59,067
Sir , do you often read the Bible ?

566
00:55:59,276 --> 00:56:01,028
- Yes , I do . - So do I.

567
00:56:02,487 --> 00:56:03,780
What about the DSM ?

568
00:56:03,989 --> 00:56:06,867
The Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders ...

569
00:56:10,329 --> 00:56:11,830
- Have you read that ? - No .

570
00:56:12,039 --> 00:56:14,291
So you 're not aware that according to the DSM

571
00:56:14,499 --> 00:56:18,629
a person 's refusal to eat is a common indication of anorexia ?

572
00:56:18,837 --> 00:56:22,299
Objection . The witness just said he hasn 't read the DSM , Your Honor .

573
00:56:22,508 --> 00:56:24,801
- Sustained . - Mr. Rose

574
00:56:25,344 --> 00:56:27,554
are you aware that catatonic rigidity

575
00:56:27,763 --> 00:56:30,140
specifically a locking up of the body 's joints

576
00:56:30,349 --> 00:56:31,975
is a known symptom of psychosis ?

577
00:56:32,184 --> 00:56:34,478
No . I haven 't studied these things .

578
00:56:34,686 --> 00:56:36,813
Have you ever visited an insane asylum

579
00:56:37,189 --> 00:56:39,274
or a hospital for the mentally ill ?

580
00:56:40,025 --> 00:56:42,819
Once . My aunt was in one before she died .

581
00:56:43,028 --> 00:56:46,114
Really ? So there 's a history of mental illness in your family ?

582
00:56:46,698 --> 00:56:48,158
I suppose .

583
00:56:48,367 --> 00:56:51,245
Sir , if you saw someone eating insects

584
00:56:51,703 --> 00:56:55,958
on a street corner , would you say that that person is mentally ill ?

585
00:56:56,166 --> 00:56:58,627
- Probably , yes . - So can you say with confidence

586
00:56:58,836 --> 00:57:01,421
that the behavior you saw in your daughter 's bedroom

587
00:57:01,630 --> 00:57:04,508
could not be the behavior of someone suffering from psychosis ?

588
00:57:04,716 --> 00:57:08,512
I don 't know . She never had any problems like that before .

589
00:57:09,179 --> 00:57:13,016
It just didn 't feel that way to me or to Father Moore .

590
00:57:14,434 --> 00:57:16,270
- And you trusted him , right ? - Yes .

591
00:57:16,478 --> 00:57:18,146
He is our parish priest .

592
00:57:18,355 --> 00:57:21,525
Fair enough . And after that night , would you say that you

593
00:57:21,733 --> 00:57:24,278
put your daughter entirely in Father Moore 's care ?

594
00:57:24,486 --> 00:57:26,989
Yes . We had done all we could .

595
00:57:27,239 --> 00:57:29,533
We said she was in his hands now

596
00:57:30,033 --> 00:57:31,869
body and soul .

597
00:57:33,036 --> 00:57:35,998
Thank you . No further questions , Your Honor .

598
00:57:36,206 --> 00:57:38,166
Thank you , Mr. Rose . You may step down .

599
00:57:40,419 --> 00:57:43,213
The defense calls Dr. Sadira Adani .

600
00:57:43,422 --> 00:57:47,551
I am currently a professor of anthropology and psychiatry

601
00:57:47,759 --> 00:57:49,845
at Northwestern University .

602
00:57:50,053 --> 00:57:51,722
Where did you receive your education ?

603
00:57:51,930 --> 00:57:54,141
At Yale , and then at Cambridge .

604
00:57:54,349 --> 00:57:56,727
And what is your specific area of expertise ?

605
00:57:56,935 --> 00:58:01,231
I study the spiritual experiences of people in various cultures

606
00:58:01,440 --> 00:58:04,735
and the physiological and psychological changes

607
00:58:04,943 --> 00:58:08,322
they undergo during these experiences .

608
00:58:08,530 --> 00:58:12,534
Would it be accurate to say that you specialize in the study of possession ?

609
00:58:12,743 --> 00:58:17,706
Yes . " Possession " is one term for a basic human experience

610
00:58:17,915 --> 00:58:22,753
reported by a great number of people all around the world .

611
00:58:22,920 --> 00:58:26,965
In my fieldwork , I 've seen many people who experienced

612
00:58:27,174 --> 00:58:31,929
a sense of being invaded by an entity from the supernatural realm .

613
00:58:32,095 --> 00:58:34,056
Why do you think Emily was invaded ?

614
00:58:34,264 --> 00:58:36,517
Why did this possession happen to her ?

615
00:58:36,725 --> 00:58:39,144
Based on my study of the case file

616
00:58:39,353 --> 00:58:43,398
I believe that Emily Rose was a hypersensitive .

617
00:58:43,649 --> 00:58:46,109
A person with an unusual connection

618
00:58:46,318 --> 00:58:50,113
to what Carlos Castaneda called " the separate reality . "

619
00:58:50,656 --> 00:58:55,244
Hypersensitives are born different from everyone else .

620
00:58:55,494 --> 00:58:59,289
They can have visions of the future , or see the dead

621
00:58:59,498 --> 00:59:02,751
and sometimes be uniquely susceptible

622
00:59:02,960 --> 00:59:05,921
to invasion by an entity that is alien to them .

623
00:59:06,129 --> 00:59:07,256
Objection .

624
00:59:09,216 --> 00:59:10,676
On what grounds ?

625
00:59:10,884 --> 00:59:12,719
How about silliness , Your Honor ?

626
00:59:12,928 --> 00:59:14,638
A young girl suffered terribly and died .

627
00:59:14,847 --> 00:59:18,308
Do we have to subject her illness to this pseudoscientific analysis ?

628
00:59:18,517 --> 00:59:21,436
Both counselors , please approach the bench .

629
00:59:21,854 --> 00:59:24,398
Your Honor , this testimony is beyond ridiculous . Visions ...

630
00:59:24,606 --> 00:59:27,776
Supernatural belief systems are shared by millions of people .

631
00:59:27,985 --> 00:59:29,361
We 're in The Twilight Zone here .

632
00:59:29,570 --> 00:59:31,947
Her expertise is relevant to the issues in this case .

633
00:59:32,155 --> 00:59:34,241
Let 's have a witch doctor sift through bones ...

634
00:59:34,449 --> 00:59:35,868
Stop .

635
00:59:39,371 --> 00:59:41,164
We 've heard a great deal of testimony

636
00:59:41,373 --> 00:59:45,419
in support of a medical explanation for Emily 's condition .

637
00:59:45,627 --> 00:59:47,713
Now we have a witness who has spent her career

638
00:59:47,921 --> 00:59:51,175
studying the defense 's alternative explanation .

639
00:59:51,383 --> 00:59:53,343
An exorcism expert , if you will .

640
00:59:54,720 --> 00:59:56,972
I think we 'll hear what she has to say .

641
00:59:57,181 --> 00:59:58,432
Thank you , Your Honor .

642
01:00:00,809 --> 01:00:05,314
Dr. Adani , why do you think Emily 's exorcism failed ?

643
01:00:05,772 --> 01:00:10,694
The medical treatment . Specifically , the drug Gambutrol .

644
01:00:10,903 --> 01:00:12,362
Please explain .

645
01:00:12,571 --> 01:00:16,950
The exorcism ritual results in a specific brain activity

646
01:00:17,159 --> 01:00:20,871
that cuts the person off from the possession experience .

647
01:00:21,622 --> 01:00:25,876
But Emily 's exorcism could not have achieved this

648
01:00:26,084 --> 01:00:28,795
because the doctor gave her Gambutrol

649
01:00:29,004 --> 01:00:32,883
which has an intoxicating effect on the brain .

650
01:00:33,050 --> 01:00:37,012
The drug made her immune to the psycho-spiritual shock

651
01:00:37,221 --> 01:00:40,140
that exorcism is intended to provide .

652
01:00:40,349 --> 01:00:44,311
What do you believe was the result of treatment with this intoxicating drug ?

653
01:00:44,520 --> 01:00:48,232
Gambutrol locked Emily in the possessed state .

654
01:00:48,398 --> 01:00:51,777
This left her unable to respond to the exorcism

655
01:00:51,985 --> 01:00:56,240
and therefore , it directly contributed to her death .

656
01:00:57,491 --> 01:00:59,326
Thank you , doctor .

657
01:01:00,702 --> 01:01:02,204
No further questions .

658
01:01:08,335 --> 01:01:11,296
I 'm looking at a list of your published articles , doctor .

659
01:01:11,630 --> 01:01:13,715
You 've been quite busy and prolific .

660
01:01:14,049 --> 01:01:17,719
So based on your time spent with Holy Roller snake-handlers

661
01:01:17,928 --> 01:01:22,182
voodoo priestesses and Indians tripping on peyote buds

662
01:01:22,474 --> 01:01:26,395
based on observing these bizarre individuals

663
01:01:26,603 --> 01:01:28,689
you 've concluded that possession is

664
01:01:28,897 --> 01:01:30,524
a basic , typical human experience ?

665
01:01:30,732 --> 01:01:32,359
I must say , counselor

666
01:01:32,609 --> 01:01:35,279
that 's quite a laundry list of disdain

667
01:01:35,487 --> 01:01:39,116
and one that thoroughly mischaracterizes my research .

668
01:01:39,533 --> 01:01:44,288
No , I don 't think possession is a typical experience .

669
01:01:44,496 --> 01:01:49,334
But I am convinced that it is a scientifically verified

670
01:01:49,543 --> 01:01:51,503
culturally universal one .

671
01:01:51,587 --> 01:01:54,089
Have you ever used Gambutrol in your studies

672
01:01:54,298 --> 01:01:57,843
to test your theory about its effect on the possession experience ?

673
01:01:57,926 --> 01:02:01,513
Absolutely not . That would be dangerous to the patient .

674
01:02:01,722 --> 01:02:05,684
So this notion of Gambutrol locking someone in a possessed state

675
01:02:05,893 --> 01:02:09,354
the key to your assertion that her medical treatment harmed Emily

676
01:02:09,563 --> 01:02:11,773
this would be your own pet theory , correct ?

677
01:02:12,024 --> 01:02:14,693
- You 're just making this one up ? - Objection . Argumentative .

678
01:02:14,943 --> 01:02:16,361
Sustained .

679
01:02:16,570 --> 01:02:20,157
Although I think he 's just taking a page from your book , counselor .

680
01:02:20,240 --> 01:02:22,492
No further questions .

681
01:02:30,334 --> 01:02:31,919
Erin !

682
01:02:32,419 --> 01:02:34,296
I 've got a doctor who wants to testify .

683
01:02:34,838 --> 01:02:36,507
He 's an eyewitness , Erin .

684
01:02:36,715 --> 01:02:38,550
He was there . He was at the exorcism .

685
01:02:38,759 --> 01:02:40,093
- What ? - He called us .

686
01:02:40,677 --> 01:02:43,472
Dr. Graham Cartwright , Department of Abnormal Psychiatry

687
01:02:43,639 --> 01:02:45,599
at St. Mary 's Hospital .

688
01:02:52,481 --> 01:02:55,734
Dr. Cartwright . Ring a bell ?

689
01:02:56,193 --> 01:02:57,653
Yes .

690
01:02:58,153 --> 01:02:59,947
He was there ?

691
01:03:00,572 --> 01:03:03,116
- Yes . - Father

692
01:03:03,951 --> 01:03:06,537
if you want me to defend you , you 've got to give me

693
01:03:06,745 --> 01:03:08,288
all the information I need .

694
01:03:08,497 --> 01:03:11,375
With all of this medical testimony helping the prosecution

695
01:03:11,583 --> 01:03:15,003
how could you not tell me that a doctor attended the exorcism ?

696
01:03:17,089 --> 01:03:20,759
He asked that I keep his involvement confidential

697
01:03:21,301 --> 01:03:22,678
and I said I would .

698
01:03:38,443 --> 01:03:40,279
Dr. Cartwright ?

699
01:03:42,781 --> 01:03:46,326
I recognize you from those courtroom drawings on the news .

700
01:03:47,035 --> 01:03:49,705
You 're much prettier in real life .

701
01:03:51,123 --> 01:03:54,376
- May I sit ? - Yes , please .

702
01:04:00,883 --> 01:04:02,426
You 're losing .

703
01:04:04,803 --> 01:04:07,556
I had hoped Father Moore wouldn 't need me

704
01:04:07,931 --> 01:04:10,309
but I don 't wanna see him put away .

705
01:04:12,102 --> 01:04:13,687
How do you know him ?

706
01:04:13,896 --> 01:04:17,482
Well , I was his parishioner at St. Vincent 's Church

707
01:04:17,691 --> 01:04:19,151
about 15 years ago .

708
01:04:19,735 --> 01:04:23,906
I hadn 't seen or heard of him for years when he called me last fall .

709
01:04:24,323 --> 01:04:26,700
But he needed help , so ...

710
01:04:28,285 --> 01:04:30,245
What kind of help , doctor ?

711
01:04:30,662 --> 01:04:34,458
He wanted a medical perspective from a psychiatrist

712
01:04:34,666 --> 01:04:37,920
you know , one that he knew , trusted

713
01:04:38,128 --> 01:04:43,550
to observe Emily 's physical and mental state during this ...

714
01:04:45,385 --> 01:04:47,346
During the exorcism .

715
01:04:47,679 --> 01:04:49,431
Yeah .

716
01:04:56,104 --> 01:04:57,648
Doctor .

717
01:04:58,690 --> 01:05:00,317
Doctor .

718
01:05:02,361 --> 01:05:03,904
Can you help our case ?

719
01:05:06,657 --> 01:05:09,535
That girl was not schizophrenic

720
01:05:09,743 --> 01:05:12,829
and she was not epileptic , or any combination of the two .

721
01:05:13,038 --> 01:05:15,249
I 've seen hundreds of people with those problems .

722
01:05:15,457 --> 01:05:19,795
They can be terrible afflictions , of course , but they don 't scare me .

723
01:05:20,003 --> 01:05:22,881
But what you saw that night in Emily , that did scare you .

724
01:05:23,048 --> 01:05:25,717
God , if I 'd known , I never would 've been there .

725
01:05:29,054 --> 01:05:32,099
I started praying again since then , you know .

726
01:05:35,352 --> 01:05:39,398
I examined that girl before I drove back to the city that night .

727
01:05:39,773 --> 01:05:41,233
She was lucid

728
01:05:41,400 --> 01:05:45,279
and she was completely aware of this separate entity inside her .

729
01:05:45,654 --> 01:05:50,701
When she wasn 't in his grip , she was totally herself , completely normal .

730
01:05:50,909 --> 01:05:54,913
The awareness of her alternate mental state is counterindicative of psychosis .

731
01:05:55,122 --> 01:05:56,748
Crazy people don 't know they 're crazy .

732
01:05:56,957 --> 01:05:58,417
That 's right .

733
01:05:59,084 --> 01:06:02,129
You 'll testify to all of this , in detail ?

734
01:06:02,337 --> 01:06:03,881
Everything you saw ?

735
01:06:04,089 --> 01:06:06,925
Send me the case files and tell me when to be in court .

736
01:06:07,134 --> 01:06:09,136
Thank you , doctor .

737
01:06:10,095 --> 01:06:11,847
We need this .

738
01:06:12,973 --> 01:06:16,226
Before he was arrested , Father Moore sent this to me .

739
01:06:16,435 --> 01:06:18,812
He asked me to take care of it .

740
01:06:20,022 --> 01:06:22,232
It 's your burden now .

741
01:06:24,276 --> 01:06:26,236
One more thing . When you saw Emily

742
01:06:26,445 --> 01:06:29,406
did Father Moore ask you to give her any medical help ?

743
01:06:29,990 --> 01:06:34,661
He was already trying to stop her from injuring herself and urging her to eat .

744
01:06:34,870 --> 01:06:37,497
And I told him , as a doctor , I couldn 't help her .

745
01:06:45,422 --> 01:06:47,799
Dr. Cartwright 's going to testify .

746
01:06:53,096 --> 01:06:54,723
Don 't you get it ?

747
01:06:54,932 --> 01:06:57,142
He 's not just an eyewitness to the exorcism .

748
01:06:57,351 --> 01:07:00,521
He can also refute the prosecution 's medical case . This is huge for us .

749
01:07:00,729 --> 01:07:02,731
When do I get to testify ?

750
01:07:03,565 --> 01:07:05,901
I don 't know . Let 's take this one step at a time .

751
01:07:06,109 --> 01:07:07,402
No .

752
01:07:07,611 --> 01:07:12,699
What matters most is Emily 's story , which only I can tell .

753
01:07:14,159 --> 01:07:16,203
I understand .

754
01:07:19,456 --> 01:07:21,375
Have you thought about what I said before ?

755
01:07:22,459 --> 01:07:26,338
About dark forces and demonic attacks ?

756
01:07:30,884 --> 01:07:33,095
Yes , I have .

757
01:07:38,684 --> 01:07:42,187
That day , after Briggs testified

758
01:07:44,898 --> 01:07:46,692
I was feeling awful .

759
01:07:47,025 --> 01:07:50,863
And I went out for a walk just to clear my head

760
01:07:51,071 --> 01:07:55,325
and I was thinking about what you said to me . Thinking :

761
01:07:56,076 --> 01:07:58,662
" What if demons really do exist ? "

762
01:07:58,871 --> 01:08:02,332
And wondering what that would mean if I believed that .

763
01:08:03,500 --> 01:08:08,213
Because God knows , I have my own demons .

764
01:08:10,048 --> 01:08:12,217
And I saw something lying on the sidewalk .

765
01:08:17,639 --> 01:08:19,224
It was a gold locket

766
01:08:20,058 --> 01:08:23,520
with the initials E. C.B. Engraved on it .

767
01:08:26,690 --> 01:08:29,234
My middle name is Christine .

768
01:08:29,443 --> 01:08:32,821
Erin Christine Bruner .

769
01:08:33,322 --> 01:08:38,243
And of all the people walking by that day , I found that locket .

770
01:08:38,452 --> 01:08:40,162
What are the chances of that ?

771
01:08:41,622 --> 01:08:44,249
I don 't know , maybe it was a sign .

772
01:08:44,458 --> 01:08:48,504
Or maybe it was just some incredible coincidence .

773
01:08:48,712 --> 01:08:51,089
But it made me feel

774
01:08:51,256 --> 01:08:55,469
like no matter what mistakes I 've made in the past

775
01:08:55,677 --> 01:08:59,431
at that moment , I was exactly where I was meant to be .

776
01:08:59,640 --> 01:09:01,808
Like I was on the right path .

777
01:09:04,186 --> 01:09:07,898
You sound more like a mystic than an agnostic .

778
01:09:09,733 --> 01:09:11,985
Are you wearing the locket now ?

779
01:09:13,737 --> 01:09:14,947
No .

780
01:09:16,281 --> 01:09:18,075
You should .

781
01:09:22,788 --> 01:09:25,874
The archdiocese doesn 't want you to testify .

782
01:09:28,085 --> 01:09:30,295
They 're just afraid that I 'll embarrass them .

783
01:09:30,504 --> 01:09:33,757
Testify to some medieval-sounding supernatural nonsense .

784
01:09:34,216 --> 01:09:36,760
They 're expecting me to talk you out of it .

785
01:09:37,636 --> 01:09:39,638
I 've just decided I 'm not even gonna try .

786
01:09:41,139 --> 01:09:42,891
Why not ?

787
01:09:43,851 --> 01:09:46,019
If the archdiocese wants to avoid embarrassment

788
01:09:46,228 --> 01:09:48,897
they need you to walk out of here a free man .

789
01:09:49,857 --> 01:09:52,234
I believe a jury will find you sincere and credible

790
01:09:52,442 --> 01:09:55,279
and when Dr. Cartwright corroborates your testimony

791
01:09:55,487 --> 01:09:57,781
and refutes the prosecution 's medical arguments

792
01:09:57,990 --> 01:09:59,616
we 'll get an acquittal .

793
01:10:00,492 --> 01:10:02,828
And everyone will thank me for it .

794
01:10:44,244 --> 01:10:45,954
Emily !

795
01:10:58,717 --> 01:11:00,427
God help me .

796
01:11:07,809 --> 01:11:10,938
Do you swear to tell the truth , the whole truth , so help you God ?

797
01:11:11,146 --> 01:11:12,356
I do .

798
01:11:12,564 --> 01:11:14,900
Father Moore , before you could perform the exorcism

799
01:11:15,108 --> 01:11:17,694
you had to get the sanction of the Church , correct ?

800
01:11:17,903 --> 01:11:20,197
Yes , on October the 27th of last year

801
01:11:20,405 --> 01:11:24,201
I presented my assessment and recommendation to the archbishop

802
01:11:24,409 --> 01:11:28,038
and he authorized the exorcism that day before I left his office .

803
01:11:29,873 --> 01:11:31,875
Tell us what happened that night .

804
01:11:32,209 --> 01:11:33,961
I drove home .

805
01:11:34,169 --> 01:11:37,381
I sat up till after midnight studying The Roman Ritual

806
01:11:37,589 --> 01:11:39,132
thinking about what lay ahead .

807
01:11:39,341 --> 01:11:41,260
You mean The Roman Ritual of Exorcism .

808
01:11:41,468 --> 01:11:43,011
A text used by Catholic priests

809
01:11:43,220 --> 01:11:45,222
as a guide to performing the exorcism rite .

810
01:11:45,430 --> 01:11:48,100
Yes , I think I actually fell asleep with the book in my hand .

811
01:11:48,308 --> 01:11:50,018
What happened next ?

812
01:11:50,352 --> 01:11:52,396
I woke up , freezing .

813
01:11:53,146 --> 01:11:55,691
It was exactly 3 a.m.

814
01:11:55,899 --> 01:11:58,610
Three a.m. Is the demonic witching hour .

815
01:11:58,986 --> 01:12:01,905
It 's a way for demons to mock the Holy Trinity .

816
01:12:02,072 --> 01:12:05,367
It 's an inversion of 3 p.m. , the miracle hour

817
01:12:05,576 --> 01:12:10,205
which is traditionally accepted as the hour of Christ 's death .

818
01:12:10,789 --> 01:12:13,250
I thought I smelled something burning .

819
01:12:15,085 --> 01:12:17,087
Only later did I connect it

820
01:12:17,462 --> 01:12:20,549
and I remembered that that same smell of something burning

821
01:12:20,757 --> 01:12:23,260
had been perceived by Emily .

822
01:13:31,662 --> 01:13:36,875
Holy Mary , mother of God , pray for us sinners , now and ...

823
01:13:40,921 --> 01:13:45,592
Pray for us sinners , now and at the hour of our ...

824
01:13:50,347 --> 01:13:52,140
At the hour of ...

825
01:14:22,629 --> 01:14:27,176
What do you make of this gesture , this nod in your direction ?

826
01:14:28,218 --> 01:14:33,265
I don 't know . Some kind of acknowledgment , I guess .

827
01:14:33,891 --> 01:14:35,976
That the game is on .

828
01:14:39,271 --> 01:14:41,982
You 're really God 's gunslinger , aren 't you , Father ?

829
01:14:42,191 --> 01:14:45,652
Standing tall and facing the devil with your prayer book at your side .

830
01:14:45,861 --> 01:14:48,197
Objection , Your Honor . Counsel 's harassing my witness .

831
01:14:48,405 --> 01:14:52,826
Sustained . Mr. Thomas , you know I won 't allow that in my courtroom .

832
01:14:53,035 --> 01:14:55,037
Forgive me , Your Honor .

833
01:14:56,622 --> 01:15:00,876
Father , did you understand this black-robed figure to be the devil ?

834
01:15:01,084 --> 01:15:02,878
I believe it was a demonic manifestation .

835
01:15:03,086 --> 01:15:05,422
Like the demonic force you believe possessed Emily ?

836
01:15:05,631 --> 01:15:07,591
- Yes . - Why do you think it appeared to you ?

837
01:15:07,799 --> 01:15:10,135
I believe the demonic can appear as an apparition

838
01:15:10,344 --> 01:15:13,305
much like a ghost , in an attempt to excite our fear .

839
01:15:13,764 --> 01:15:16,808
- Did it excite your fear , Father ? - It scared the hell out of me .

840
01:15:17,768 --> 01:15:20,479
So this night , when you began to prepare Emily 's exorcism

841
01:15:20,687 --> 01:15:23,106
was it your first encounter with this demon ghost ?

842
01:15:23,315 --> 01:15:25,192
- Yes . - Have you seen it again ?

843
01:15:28,779 --> 01:15:30,072
I 've seen it ever since .

844
01:15:35,744 --> 01:15:38,121
No further questions at this time .

845
01:15:42,626 --> 01:15:44,711
Redirect , Your Honor .

846
01:15:46,630 --> 01:15:49,341
Father Moore , after you received the bishop 's authorization

847
01:15:49,550 --> 01:15:51,301
when did you proceed with an exorcism ?

848
01:15:51,510 --> 01:15:52,803
October 31st .

849
01:15:53,387 --> 01:15:55,806
On Halloween . Isn 't that a bit dramatic ?

850
01:15:56,640 --> 01:15:59,852
Halloween tradition is based on legends throughout history

851
01:16:00,060 --> 01:16:03,188
that indicate a real increase in spiritual activity on that night

852
01:16:03,397 --> 01:16:06,441
and I thought we could use the occasion to draw them into the open .

853
01:16:06,650 --> 01:16:08,819
- The demons , you mean ? - Yes .

854
01:16:09,027 --> 01:16:10,487
Father Moore

855
01:16:12,197 --> 01:16:14,283
can you identify this ?

856
01:16:14,533 --> 01:16:18,245
It 's my tape recorder . I used it to record the exorcism .

857
01:16:18,954 --> 01:16:21,456
Inside is the tape I made that night .

858
01:16:22,583 --> 01:16:24,376
Why would you make such a tape ?

859
01:16:24,585 --> 01:16:26,628
Ever since the technology has been available

860
01:16:26,837 --> 01:16:30,299
exorcists have used tape recorders to authenticate the ritual

861
01:16:30,507 --> 01:16:32,176
and provide a record for review .

862
01:16:32,384 --> 01:16:35,387
I offer into evidence this cassette recorder and audiotape ...

863
01:16:35,596 --> 01:16:38,807
Objection . The people were not aware of the existence of this tape

864
01:16:39,016 --> 01:16:40,684
until last night . - Neither were we .

865
01:16:40,893 --> 01:16:43,854
This tape is new evidence that came into our possession yesterday .

866
01:16:44,062 --> 01:16:47,274
We provided counsel for the people with a transcript of its contents .

867
01:16:47,482 --> 01:16:49,860
You mean this tape was not given to you by your client ?

868
01:16:50,068 --> 01:16:52,613
No , Your Honor . We received it from a reluctant witness

869
01:16:52,821 --> 01:16:56,366
Dr. Graham Cartwright , who will also be called to testify to its authenticity .

870
01:16:56,575 --> 01:16:59,328
The people will find his name on the updated witness list

871
01:16:59,536 --> 01:17:01,163
we provided to them this morning .

872
01:17:05,542 --> 01:17:07,836
Very well . I 'll allow it into evidence .

873
01:17:11,673 --> 01:17:13,425
Father Moore .

874
01:17:15,177 --> 01:17:17,346
Will you play the tape for us now ?

875
01:17:24,811 --> 01:17:27,731
This is the exorcism of Emily Rose .

876
01:17:28,232 --> 01:17:31,693
Those present are myself , Father Richard Moore

877
01:17:32,778 --> 01:17:36,198
Nathaniel , Emily 's father

878
01:17:37,241 --> 01:17:40,327
Jason , her friend

879
01:17:41,078 --> 01:17:45,707
a doctor who is here to monitor Emily during the ritual

880
01:17:46,416 --> 01:17:48,293
and Emily herself

881
01:17:48,502 --> 01:17:52,422
who has given her permission for the ritual to be performed .

882
01:17:53,841 --> 01:17:55,592
All right , now listen .

883
01:17:57,678 --> 01:18:01,598
You may say the rosary or any private prayer for her deliverance

884
01:18:01,807 --> 01:18:04,810
when you 're not responding to my words .

885
01:18:05,018 --> 01:18:06,770
Above all

886
01:18:07,354 --> 01:18:10,107
do whatever I ask , without question .

887
01:18:12,109 --> 01:18:14,444
Don 't ask it any questions

888
01:18:14,653 --> 01:18:17,990
or pay any attention to what it says .

889
01:18:19,449 --> 01:18:20,784
" It " ?

890
01:18:20,993 --> 01:18:23,370
We won 't be dealing with Emily tonight .

891
01:18:28,625 --> 01:18:30,210
Restrain her .

892
01:18:37,551 --> 01:18:41,555
Lord Jesus Christ , have mercy on us .

893
01:19:03,035 --> 01:19:04,244
It has begun .

894
01:19:04,745 --> 01:19:05,829
Let us pray .

895
01:19:12,920 --> 01:19:15,297
" Because she hopes in you , my God . "

896
01:19:15,506 --> 01:19:18,425
" Send her help from the holy place , Lord . "

897
01:19:18,800 --> 01:19:21,261
" And give her heavenly protection . "

898
01:19:21,512 --> 01:19:23,597
" May the Lord be with you . "

899
01:19:23,805 --> 01:19:26,141
" And with your spirit . "

900
01:19:26,350 --> 01:19:31,480
Our Father , who art in heaven , hallowed be thy name .

901
01:19:33,732 --> 01:19:34,858
My God . Are you all right ?

902
01:19:35,067 --> 01:19:37,319
Dolls and kisses and crosses and wishes

903
01:19:37,528 --> 01:19:40,322
you think that can save your little girl ?

904
01:19:44,409 --> 01:19:47,871
Thy kingdom come , thy will be done , on earth as it is in heaven .

905
01:19:48,038 --> 01:19:49,748
I 'm fine .

906
01:19:49,957 --> 01:19:52,501
Give us this day our daily bread .

907
01:19:52,709 --> 01:19:58,131
And forgive us our trespasses as we forgive those that trespass against us .

908
01:19:58,340 --> 01:20:00,217
And lead us not into temptation ...

909
01:20:00,425 --> 01:20:04,680
But deliver us from evil !

910
01:20:06,098 --> 01:20:09,560
Who are you , demon ? Tell me your name .

911
01:20:17,901 --> 01:20:21,530
I am the one who dwells within ...

912
01:20:22,406 --> 01:20:23,407
In the Name of Christ

913
01:20:23,615 --> 01:20:25,701
identify yourself !

914
01:20:25,951 --> 01:20:29,413
One , two , three , four , five , six . One , two , three , four , five , six .

915
01:20:29,621 --> 01:20:32,708
Trick or treat . I give you treats and tricks .

916
01:20:32,916 --> 01:20:35,794
One , two , three , four , five , six .

917
01:20:41,592 --> 01:20:42,926
Father Moore !

918
01:20:54,062 --> 01:20:55,230
Papa !

919
01:21:06,658 --> 01:21:08,410
Emily !

920
01:21:21,715 --> 01:21:23,342
Emily !

921
01:21:24,301 --> 01:21:28,680
She feels so hot , Father ! She 's burning up !

922
01:21:32,643 --> 01:21:35,771
Hold her down there on the straw ! Hold her !

923
01:21:40,859 --> 01:21:42,069
Emily !

924
01:21:57,918 --> 01:22:02,297
Doctor ! I need you here now .

925
01:22:04,091 --> 01:22:06,134
Watch her vital signs .

926
01:22:06,218 --> 01:22:08,720
In the beginning was the word .

927
01:22:08,929 --> 01:22:10,681
And the word was with God .

928
01:22:10,889 --> 01:22:14,309
And the word was the word , and what a wonderful word it was .

929
01:22:14,518 --> 01:22:15,853
Through him all things remain .

930
01:22:16,061 --> 01:22:18,647
Without him , nothing was made that has been made .

931
01:22:20,816 --> 01:22:23,861
And the 70 disciples returned again with joy , saying :

932
01:22:24,069 --> 01:22:27,781
" Lord , even the devils are subject unto us through thy name . "

933
01:22:27,990 --> 01:22:31,201
Her heart is racing . It 's almost 180 beats a minute .

934
01:22:31,410 --> 01:22:35,163
I beheld Satan as lightning fall from heaven .

935
01:22:36,123 --> 01:22:40,127
Behold . I give you power to tread on serpents and scorpions

936
01:22:40,335 --> 01:22:42,462
and over all the power of the enemy .

937
01:22:42,671 --> 01:22:45,757
And nothing shall , by any means , hurt you .

938
01:22:45,966 --> 01:22:48,135
Nothing ?

939
01:23:06,069 --> 01:23:10,157
Get it off ! Get it off ! Get it off !

940
01:23:17,331 --> 01:23:21,752
Release him , demon . I command you in the name of our Lord , Jesus Christ .

941
01:23:33,764 --> 01:23:35,349
Tell me your name , wicked one .

942
01:23:35,599 --> 01:23:37,392
One , two , three , four , five , six !

943
01:23:37,601 --> 01:23:40,229
He who commands you is he who ordered you thrown down

944
01:23:40,437 --> 01:23:42,898
from the highest heaven into the depths of hell .

945
01:23:43,106 --> 01:23:48,111
In the name of our Lord , Jesus Christ , I now command you :

946
01:23:48,278 --> 01:23:49,530
Tell me your name !

947
01:23:51,949 --> 01:23:56,245
Hear , therefore , and fear , Satan , enemy of the faith .

948
01:23:56,703 --> 01:23:58,330
Give me your name , demon !

949
01:23:58,830 --> 01:24:01,416
Names !

950
01:24:01,834 --> 01:24:04,962
Names !

951
01:24:05,337 --> 01:24:10,467
One , two , three , four , five , six !

952
01:24:11,176 --> 01:24:13,345
Ancient serpents

953
01:24:14,012 --> 01:24:17,474
depart from this servant of God !

954
01:24:17,850 --> 01:24:20,185
Tell me your six names !

955
01:24:21,353 --> 01:24:25,816
We are the ones who dwell within !

956
01:24:26,525 --> 01:24:29,278
I am the one who dwelt within Cain !

957
01:24:29,486 --> 01:24:32,698
I am the one who dwelt within Nero !

958
01:24:32,906 --> 01:24:36,451
I once dwelt within Judas !

959
01:24:36,660 --> 01:24:37,995
And I was with Legion !

960
01:24:38,203 --> 01:24:40,747
I am Belial !

961
01:24:42,1000 --> 01:24:45,335
And I am Lucifer

962
01:24:45,544 --> 01:24:48,338
the devil in the flesh .

963
01:25:04,271 --> 01:25:05,480
Mr. Rose .

964
01:25:05,689 --> 01:25:07,691
Doctor , help him !

965
01:25:25,334 --> 01:25:27,753
After a few moments , Mr. Rose revived

966
01:25:27,920 --> 01:25:30,714
but the exorcism had to be abandoned .

967
01:25:31,173 --> 01:25:36,220
Emily was taken to her room and soon fell into a deep sleep .

968
01:25:36,428 --> 01:25:39,223
The whole thing was a complete failure .

969
01:25:39,723 --> 01:25:43,185
Describe her behavior from the night of the failed exorcism

970
01:25:43,393 --> 01:25:44,978
until the time of her death .

971
01:25:45,729 --> 01:25:47,481
Violence towards others and herself .

972
01:25:47,689 --> 01:25:50,567
Sometimes she screamed for hours on end .

973
01:25:50,776 --> 01:25:53,904
She drove her head through windows , tried to bite ...

974
01:25:54,112 --> 01:25:57,282
Tried to bite holes in the walls , breaking several more of her teeth

975
01:25:57,491 --> 01:25:59,952
as you saw in the postmortem photograph .

976
01:26:00,118 --> 01:26:02,246
- You witnessed this ? - Some of it , yes .

977
01:26:02,454 --> 01:26:04,623
I tried to visit every day

978
01:26:05,290 --> 01:26:06,834
and the family told me the rest .

979
01:26:07,042 --> 01:26:08,585
Did you attempt another exorcism ?

980
01:26:09,920 --> 01:26:12,589
I wanted to , but Emily refused .

981
01:26:12,798 --> 01:26:14,633
And without the consent of the possessed

982
01:26:14,842 --> 01:26:17,302
the exorcism ritual can 't be performed .

983
01:26:17,469 --> 01:26:19,096
Did you encourage her to eat ?

984
01:26:19,721 --> 01:26:21,765
Yes , every time I saw her

985
01:26:21,974 --> 01:26:24,935
but the few times she tried , it seemed like ...

986
01:26:25,519 --> 01:26:28,355
Seemed like she couldn 't swallow , or she couldn 't keep it down .

987
01:26:28,564 --> 01:26:29,857
What about medical care ?

988
01:26:30,065 --> 01:26:33,443
I wanted her to continue . I never said she should quit seeing her doctors .

989
01:26:33,652 --> 01:26:36,071
That would be wrong . Medical care is not my field .

990
01:26:36,280 --> 01:26:39,449
But you did suggest she stop taking the drug Gambutrol .

991
01:26:42,452 --> 01:26:44,121
Yes .

992
01:26:46,665 --> 01:26:50,127
After the exorcism , she asked for my counsel .

993
01:26:50,544 --> 01:26:52,796
She told me that the drugs had never helped her .

994
01:26:53,005 --> 01:26:55,841
After all , she was on Gambutrol during the exorcism

995
01:26:56,049 --> 01:26:58,552
when her so-called symptoms were at their peak .

996
01:26:59,386 --> 01:27:04,099
Ultimately , we both felt that she was beyond medical care

997
01:27:04,308 --> 01:27:08,645
and that she had to see this through to the end

998
01:27:09,146 --> 01:27:11,231
by faith alone .

999
01:27:16,028 --> 01:27:19,406
The dual voices we just heard on this tape

1000
01:27:20,282 --> 01:27:24,578
you 're certain that they were both coming from Emily at the same time ?

1001
01:27:24,786 --> 01:27:26,038
Yes . Yes , I heard them .

1002
01:27:26,246 --> 01:27:28,707
Have you tampered with this tape in any way ?

1003
01:27:29,166 --> 01:27:30,751
No . No , I have not .

1004
01:27:32,377 --> 01:27:34,755
No further questions at this time .

1005
01:27:39,551 --> 01:27:40,761
Mr. Thomas .

1006
01:27:44,598 --> 01:27:48,727
Father Moore , you consider this tape to be proof of the supernatural ?

1007
01:27:49,895 --> 01:27:53,482
I think it 's a record of certain indications

1008
01:27:53,690 --> 01:27:55,526
that Emily was possessed .

1009
01:27:55,734 --> 01:27:57,402
Signs of possession , you may call them .

1010
01:27:57,611 --> 01:28:00,822
By " signs of possession , " would you mean her speaking in languages

1011
01:28:01,031 --> 01:28:02,991
we might assume she couldn 't possibly know ?

1012
01:28:03,200 --> 01:28:06,286
And the vocalization of two distinct voices simultaneously ?

1013
01:28:06,495 --> 01:28:09,873
Yes . Among other signs that I observed and described to the court

1014
01:28:10,082 --> 01:28:11,959
while the tape was playing . Things I saw .

1015
01:28:12,167 --> 01:28:13,627
Things you can 't hear on the tape .

1016
01:28:13,836 --> 01:28:15,754
We 'll just have to take your word , won 't we ?

1017
01:28:15,963 --> 01:28:17,589
- Your Honor . - Mr. Thomas .

1018
01:28:18,173 --> 01:28:21,051
I apologize . Father , as Emily 's parish priest

1019
01:28:21,260 --> 01:28:24,096
are you aware that she underwent advanced catechism training ?

1020
01:28:24,304 --> 01:28:25,889
Yes . Yes . Her family is very devout .

1021
01:28:26,098 --> 01:28:29,434
