1022
01:28:29,643 --> 01:28:30,769
Yes , I think that 's right .

1023
01:28:30,978 --> 01:28:34,356
Might have even studied Aramaic , Christ and his disciples ' language

1024
01:28:34,565 --> 01:28:38,026
which , according to the transcripts , we also heard on the tape , correct ?

1025
01:28:38,235 --> 01:28:40,946
She spoke Aramaic on the tape . It wasn 't part of her training .

1026
01:28:41,154 --> 01:28:43,740
But it was offered as an elective at her catechism school .

1027
01:28:43,949 --> 01:28:46,743
I have the school 's curriculum here if you 'd like to see it .

1028
01:28:46,952 --> 01:28:50,706
No . I 'll accept that she might have been exposed to that language .

1029
01:28:50,914 --> 01:28:52,749
And according to her high school records

1030
01:28:52,958 --> 01:28:55,460
German was the foreign language she studied there , yes ?

1031
01:28:55,669 --> 01:28:56,879
I don 't know . If you say so .

1032
01:28:57,087 --> 01:29:00,632
So that covers the strange languages we heard on the tape , correct ?

1033
01:29:01,425 --> 01:29:03,260
Did I miss any ?

1034
01:29:04,553 --> 01:29:05,762
- No . - Good .

1035
01:29:05,971 --> 01:29:08,223
We 've already established you 're no medical expert .

1036
01:29:08,432 --> 01:29:09,683
You said it 's not your field .

1037
01:29:09,892 --> 01:29:13,604
But are you aware of the dual sets of vocal cords every human possesses ?

1038
01:29:13,896 --> 01:29:15,105
- No . - Have you heard of

1039
01:29:15,314 --> 01:29:19,610
the superior vocal cords , which are higher than the ones we use to speak ?

1040
01:29:19,818 --> 01:29:22,487
No . So you didn 't know that Tibetan monks , for example

1041
01:29:22,696 --> 01:29:25,449
as part of their religious training , teach themselves

1042
01:29:25,657 --> 01:29:29,036
to activate both sets of vocal cords at once ?

1043
01:29:29,244 --> 01:29:30,871
No , I didn 't know that .

1044
01:29:31,079 --> 01:29:33,707
Well , now that you do know , would you think it 's possible

1045
01:29:33,916 --> 01:29:35,667
that Emily , in her psychotic state

1046
01:29:35,876 --> 01:29:38,128
might have activated both sets of vocal cords

1047
01:29:38,337 --> 01:29:41,757
so as to achieve the amazing effect we heard captured on your audiotape ?

1048
01:29:41,965 --> 01:29:43,217
Her state was not psychotic .

1049
01:29:43,425 --> 01:29:46,053
Father Moore , you told us that in the exorcism we heard

1050
01:29:46,261 --> 01:29:49,723
you actually saw , once again , this black-robed figure

1051
01:29:49,932 --> 01:29:52,559
or demonic apparition , am I right ? - Yes .

1052
01:29:52,768 --> 01:29:55,354
But we couldn 't see him when you played the tape , correct ?

1053
01:29:55,562 --> 01:29:57,064
- No , of course not . - Of course not .

1054
01:29:57,272 --> 01:30:00,067
So that would be another supernatural aspect of the exorcism

1055
01:30:00,275 --> 01:30:03,737
your tape doesn 't prove , correct ? - Yes .

1056
01:30:04,530 --> 01:30:06,532
Where is your dark figure , Father ?

1057
01:30:06,698 --> 01:30:08,992
Is he here now ? Do I look like your demon ghost ?

1058
01:30:09,201 --> 01:30:11,119
- Your Honor . - Counselor .

1059
01:30:14,790 --> 01:30:16,667
I have nothing further .

1060
01:30:17,751 --> 01:30:19,670
Does the defense wish to redirect ?

1061
01:30:19,878 --> 01:30:23,298
No , Your Honor , but we reserve the right to recall the witness later .

1062
01:30:23,590 --> 01:30:26,343
Very well . The witness may step down .

1063
01:30:33,350 --> 01:30:36,144
Your Honor , my next witness must have been detained .

1064
01:30:36,353 --> 01:30:38,313
If we could take a short recess so I could ...

1065
01:30:38,522 --> 01:30:41,984
You 've made this court wait before , counselor . I 'm inclined to ...

1066
01:30:42,192 --> 01:30:43,819
Your Honor , please .

1067
01:30:44,027 --> 01:30:46,655
Dr. Cartwright came to us in good conscience

1068
01:30:46,864 --> 01:30:49,950
as an eyewitness to the exorcism on Father Moore 's tape .

1069
01:30:50,158 --> 01:30:53,203
He can substantiate all of my client 's testimony ...

1070
01:30:53,412 --> 01:30:56,540
Your Honor , the defense has already presented its exorcism testimony

1071
01:30:56,748 --> 01:30:59,334
in dramatic fashion . Do we really have to .. ?

1072
01:31:05,757 --> 01:31:09,219
We have absorbed some extraordinary testimony today .

1073
01:31:09,761 --> 01:31:12,347
I think we 'll take some time to consider it .

1074
01:31:12,556 --> 01:31:15,225
Court is adjourned until 9 : 30 tomorrow morning .

1075
01:31:17,728 --> 01:31:20,606
- You can 't find him ? - I went to meet him , he didn 't show .

1076
01:31:20,814 --> 01:31:22,816
I called his office , I called his house .

1077
01:31:23,025 --> 01:31:27,654
Okay . Go to the hospital , ask around . Somebody 's gotta know where he is .

1078
01:31:40,334 --> 01:31:41,793
What the hell happened ?

1079
01:31:43,337 --> 01:31:45,714
Tell Father Moore I 'm sorry .

1080
01:31:45,964 --> 01:31:49,927
Tell him I know the demons are real and I admire his courage

1081
01:31:50,135 --> 01:31:52,304
for standing and speaking against them .

1082
01:31:52,638 --> 01:31:55,390
Tell him I know what they can do .

1083
01:32:17,996 --> 01:32:20,832
- Cartwright 's dead . - I heard .

1084
01:32:21,959 --> 01:32:23,418
Are you drunk ?

1085
01:32:25,087 --> 01:32:28,632
- Not yet , but I 'm working on it . - Have you seen this ?

1086
01:32:34,096 --> 01:32:36,014
- What the hell were you thinking ? - Karl ...

1087
01:32:36,223 --> 01:32:38,559
You told me you 'd talk him out of testifying .

1088
01:32:38,767 --> 01:32:41,061
Instead , you put on a freak show with taped demons

1089
01:32:41,270 --> 01:32:43,021
and a dead girl speaking in tongues

1090
01:32:43,230 --> 01:32:47,442
and your client testifies that the archbishop sanctioned the exorcism .

1091
01:32:48,068 --> 01:32:50,112
We 'll be lucky if the archdiocese isn 't named ...

1092
01:32:50,362 --> 01:32:52,781
I had a doctor who was gonna corroborate .

1093
01:32:52,990 --> 01:32:55,909
Besides that , Father Moore 's testimony 's crucial to his defense .

1094
01:32:56,118 --> 01:32:58,620
Did you forget the archdiocese is paying for this defense ?

1095
01:32:58,871 --> 01:33:00,664
The archdiocese isn 't on trial .

1096
01:33:02,499 --> 01:33:04,960
I swore an oath to do what 's best for my client .

1097
01:33:05,169 --> 01:33:07,254
Spare me the law school pieties , Bruner .

1098
01:33:07,462 --> 01:33:09,464
You cashed in your conscience at the door .

1099
01:33:09,715 --> 01:33:12,593
- People can change . - Like James Van Hopper ?

1100
01:33:16,221 --> 01:33:17,806
It 's not over .

1101
01:33:18,557 --> 01:33:20,184
I can put Mr. Rose on the stand

1102
01:33:20,392 --> 01:33:22,561
to corroborate Father Moore about the exorcism .

1103
01:33:22,769 --> 01:33:25,564
And there are the girls . Her sister Alice , she saw part of it .

1104
01:33:25,772 --> 01:33:28,734
They all look like superstitious rubes . They 've got no credibility .

1105
01:33:28,901 --> 01:33:30,235
Thomas will rip them to pieces .

1106
01:33:30,444 --> 01:33:33,155
You 'll be worse off than you are now , if that 's possible .

1107
01:33:34,156 --> 01:33:35,908
You 're gonna replace me on this case .

1108
01:33:36,700 --> 01:33:38,744
You 've screwed it up beyond all repair .

1109
01:33:39,411 --> 01:33:41,747
But the archdiocese feels that replacing you now

1110
01:33:41,955 --> 01:33:44,833
would only draw more unnecessary attention to the trial .

1111
01:33:45,042 --> 01:33:46,543
But just so we 're clear , Bruner

1112
01:33:47,294 --> 01:33:51,507
if you put that priest on the stand again , I will fire you .

1113
01:34:18,784 --> 01:34:20,077
You 've been crying .

1114
01:34:23,539 --> 01:34:26,583
- Dr. Cartwright is dead . - What ?

1115
01:34:27,626 --> 01:34:31,880
He was killed . There was an accident . I 'm sorry .

1116
01:34:34,800 --> 01:34:36,885
I know he was your friend .

1117
01:34:40,889 --> 01:34:42,391
We 've lost .

1118
01:34:44,643 --> 01:34:47,104
Without his testimony , it 's over .

1119
01:34:48,313 --> 01:34:49,857
No .

1120
01:34:50,065 --> 01:34:54,403
No , no , no , it isn 't over . We 're telling Emily 's story . That 's what matters .

1121
01:34:54,611 --> 01:34:56,780
- It can 't be worth all this . - Yes , it is worth it .

1122
01:34:56,989 --> 01:34:59,992
Just let me go back on the stand and tell the rest of the story .

1123
01:35:00,200 --> 01:35:02,327
- I can 't do that . - You must !

1124
01:35:02,911 --> 01:35:04,621
You must .

1125
01:35:09,918 --> 01:35:14,923
Erin , you once said that you felt you were on the right path .

1126
01:35:16,049 --> 01:35:19,094
Don 't stray from that path .

1127
01:35:20,429 --> 01:35:22,097
Here , take this .

1128
01:35:22,306 --> 01:35:24,641
- What is this ? - Just read it .

1129
01:35:24,850 --> 01:35:28,187
And then decide what you want to do .

1130
01:35:29,688 --> 01:35:34,651
I saw your eyes today in court when I explained the significance of 3 a.m.

1131
01:35:35,360 --> 01:35:41,450
It 's not going to stop until Emily 's story is told .

1132
01:36:22,908 --> 01:36:24,868
Are you gonna make a statement ?

1133
01:36:27,204 --> 01:36:29,206
Do you believe it was the devil ?

1134
01:36:40,759 --> 01:36:43,387
Is the defense ready to proceed ?

1135
01:36:43,595 --> 01:36:47,474
Yes , Your Honor . The defense recalls Father Richard Moore .

1136
01:36:54,857 --> 01:36:58,151
The witness is reminded that he is still under oath .

1137
01:37:07,661 --> 01:37:10,831
- When did you last see Emily alive ? - The night before she died .

1138
01:37:11,039 --> 01:37:14,293
Her mother , Maria , called me and said that Emily had asked for me .

1139
01:37:14,501 --> 01:37:17,087
- Why did she ask to see you ? - To give me this .

1140
01:37:17,629 --> 01:37:19,923
Did Emily explain to you the letter 's significance ?

1141
01:37:20,340 --> 01:37:25,429
Yes . She said she 'd written it the morning after the failed exorcism

1142
01:37:25,721 --> 01:37:28,098
and that it was important for me to share .

1143
01:37:32,144 --> 01:37:34,938
Father Moore , was Emily a good person ?

1144
01:37:36,565 --> 01:37:41,862
I believe that one day Emily will be recognized as a saint .

1145
01:37:42,905 --> 01:37:45,741
- So she loved God . - Yes . She was very devout .

1146
01:37:46,825 --> 01:37:48,744
Father Moore , if Emily loved God

1147
01:37:48,952 --> 01:37:51,622
if she was so good and so devout , why do you think God

1148
01:37:51,830 --> 01:37:53,540
allowed this to happen ? - Objection .

1149
01:37:53,749 --> 01:37:55,417
What is the relevance of that question ?

1150
01:37:55,626 --> 01:37:57,794
Father Moore 's belief in this matter is crucial

1151
01:37:58,003 --> 01:38:01,006
in establishing his and Emily 's understanding of her condition .

1152
01:38:01,215 --> 01:38:04,176
And that mutual understanding is paramount in determining

1153
01:38:04,384 --> 01:38:06,595
whether Father Moore was , in fact , negligent .

1154
01:38:09,348 --> 01:38:10,557
I 'm going to allow it .

1155
01:38:10,766 --> 01:38:13,268
Your Honor , you 're not really gonna let someone testify

1156
01:38:13,519 --> 01:38:16,104
about why God would allow the death of a young girl ?

1157
01:38:16,313 --> 01:38:18,774
The objection has been overruled .

1158
01:38:19,358 --> 01:38:21,151
Again , Father Moore :

1159
01:38:22,694 --> 01:38:27,157
Why did God allow Emily to become possessed by demons and then die ?

1160
01:38:27,866 --> 01:38:29,952
I can let Emily answer that .

1161
01:38:34,456 --> 01:38:37,417
" Last night , on Allhallows ' Eve

1162
01:38:37,626 --> 01:38:42,047
Father Moore tried to cast six demons from my body .

1163
01:38:42,714 --> 01:38:44,508
They refused to go .

1164
01:38:45,717 --> 01:38:48,220
After the attempted exorcism ... "

1165
01:38:48,554 --> 01:38:53,183
I was taken to my room , and I fell into a deep sleep .

1166
01:38:55,060 --> 01:39:00,107
I awoke a few hours later , hearing a voice calling out my name .

1167
01:40:15,182 --> 01:40:18,477
" Again , I heard a voice calling my name .

1168
01:40:19,061 --> 01:40:22,231
It was the Blessed Holy Mother of God .

1169
01:40:23,273 --> 01:40:25,400
And when I looked at her

1170
01:40:26,026 --> 01:40:29,238
she smiled at me and said :

1171
01:40:30,030 --> 01:40:33,200
'Emily , heaven is not blind to your pain . " '

1172
01:40:33,408 --> 01:40:36,912
She said the Virgin Mary spoke to her in the middle of a field ?

1173
01:40:37,454 --> 01:40:39,831
- Yes . - And do you believe her ?

1174
01:40:40,040 --> 01:40:41,917
I believe Emily spoke the truth .

1175
01:40:43,585 --> 01:40:44,920
Please continue .

1176
01:40:47,548 --> 01:40:51,718
" I asked the Blessed Mother , 'Why do I suffer like this ? " '

1177
01:40:52,386 --> 01:40:55,347
Why did the demons not leave me tonight ?

1178
01:40:56,807 --> 01:41:00,102
" She said , ' I am sorry , Emily .

1179
01:41:00,394 --> 01:41:03,438
The demons are going to stay where they are . '

1180
01:41:04,273 --> 01:41:07,568
Then she said , 'You can come with me in peace

1181
01:41:08,068 --> 01:41:10,529
free of your bodily form

1182
01:41:11,071 --> 01:41:14,199
or you can choose to continue this .

1183
01:41:15,576 --> 01:41:17,536
You will suffer greatly .

1184
01:41:17,744 --> 01:41:23,375
But through you , many will come to see that the realm of the spirit is real .

1185
01:41:25,460 --> 01:41:28,255
The choice is yours . " '

1186
01:41:36,138 --> 01:41:38,182
I choose to stay .

1187
01:42:08,003 --> 01:42:12,174
" In the end , good will triumph over evil .

1188
01:42:12,966 --> 01:42:15,135
Through my experience

1189
01:42:15,719 --> 01:42:18,514
people will know that demons are real .

1190
01:42:20,807 --> 01:42:24,686
People say that God is dead .

1191
01:42:27,356 --> 01:42:29,816
But how can they think that

1192
01:42:30,400 --> 01:42:32,444
if I show them the devil ? "

1193
01:42:38,075 --> 01:42:42,037
Did you see these wounds on both of Emily 's hands and both feet ?

1194
01:42:42,246 --> 01:42:47,167
Yes . Yes , the wounds lasted for some time .

1195
01:42:47,376 --> 01:42:51,588
And did you attach any supernatural significance to these wounds ?

1196
01:42:52,005 --> 01:42:55,884
I believe they were stigmata .

1197
01:42:56,093 --> 01:42:58,053
By that , you mean supernatural injuries

1198
01:42:58,262 --> 01:43:01,223
that correspond to the crucifixion wounds of Jesus Christ ?

1199
01:43:01,431 --> 01:43:03,058
Yes .

1200
01:43:04,226 --> 01:43:10,399
Stigmata are a sign , a mark indicating one is touched by God .

1201
01:43:14,319 --> 01:43:18,782
After that night , why do you think Emily refused another exorcism ?

1202
01:43:20,033 --> 01:43:23,412
I believe she 'd accepted her fate .

1203
01:43:25,873 --> 01:43:28,876
Is there anything else you 'd like to say about Emily ?

1204
01:43:33,130 --> 01:43:34,506
No .

1205
01:43:37,593 --> 01:43:39,261
The defense rests .

1206
01:43:48,312 --> 01:43:50,689
Father Moore attaches divine significance

1207
01:43:50,898 --> 01:43:54,443
to the wounds on Emily 's hands and feet .

1208
01:43:54,651 --> 01:43:56,069
Why ?

1209
01:43:57,446 --> 01:44:01,408
Because he sees them as confirmation of what he wants to believe .

1210
01:44:02,701 --> 01:44:05,954
That Emily was a saint , touched by the hand of God .

1211
01:44:06,955 --> 01:44:10,501
I 'm afraid the truth is far less inspiring .

1212
01:44:11,210 --> 01:44:16,507
Because the truth is , by the time these miraculous wounds appeared

1213
01:44:17,049 --> 01:44:19,843
Emily had already shown a tendency to injure herself

1214
01:44:20,052 --> 01:44:23,305
and simply did so again on one of the barbed-wire fences

1215
01:44:23,514 --> 01:44:26,850
surrounding the Rose family farm .

1216
01:44:31,772 --> 01:44:38,028
Father Moore 's beliefs are based on archaic and irrational superstition .

1217
01:44:38,237 --> 01:44:41,198
Emily suffered because she was sick

1218
01:44:42,616 --> 01:44:44,368
not because she was a saint .

1219
01:44:46,662 --> 01:44:50,290
I 'm a man of faith . And I am also a man of facts .

1220
01:44:50,958 --> 01:44:56,547
And in here , facts are what must matter .

1221
01:44:57,881 --> 01:45:00,300
And these are the facts of this case :

1222
01:45:01,176 --> 01:45:05,430
Emily Rose had epilepsy , which caused psychosis .

1223
01:45:05,806 --> 01:45:09,351
And , given time , medicine would have cured her .

1224
01:45:09,560 --> 01:45:13,981
But it didn 't . Why ? Because Father Richard Moore convinced Emily

1225
01:45:14,189 --> 01:45:18,610
that she wasn 't ill , that she didn 't need medicine .

1226
01:45:18,819 --> 01:45:21,613
And in the weeks leading up to her death

1227
01:45:21,822 --> 01:45:25,909
when she was clearly in need of medical treatment

1228
01:45:26,577 --> 01:45:28,787
he failed to have her hospitalized .

1229
01:45:37,421 --> 01:45:39,298
So

1230
01:45:40,048 --> 01:45:43,260
the defense has given us an extraordinary

1231
01:45:43,719 --> 01:45:48,432
creative explanation for the events that led to this .

1232
01:45:48,932 --> 01:45:55,272
Ladies and gentlemen , don 't you believe it .

1233
01:45:56,982 --> 01:46:01,695
Because the fact is , it wasn 't the devil that did this to Emily Rose .

1234
01:46:05,699 --> 01:46:07,326
It was the defendant .

1235
01:46:28,347 --> 01:46:29,932
Counselor .

1236
01:46:35,604 --> 01:46:39,233
Ethan Thomas calls himself a man of faith .

1237
01:46:44,655 --> 01:46:47,449
I , on the other hand , am a woman of doubt .

1238
01:46:51,537 --> 01:46:53,664
Angels and demons .

1239
01:46:54,498 --> 01:46:56,375
God and the devil .

1240
01:47:00,420 --> 01:47:03,757
These things either exist , or they do not exist .

1241
01:47:06,510 --> 01:47:08,220
Are we all alone in this life ?

1242
01:47:08,887 --> 01:47:10,931
Or are we not alone ?

1243
01:47:11,849 --> 01:47:13,725
Either thought is astonishing .

1244
01:47:17,604 --> 01:47:21,733
Do I really believe that this tragedy is the work of the devil ?

1245
01:47:21,942 --> 01:47:23,694
To be honest , I don 't know .

1246
01:47:25,362 --> 01:47:28,115
But I cannot deny that it 's possible .

1247
01:47:28,782 --> 01:47:30,576
The prosecution wants you to believe

1248
01:47:30,784 --> 01:47:34,079
that Emily 's psychotic epileptic disorder was a fact

1249
01:47:34,288 --> 01:47:38,375
because facts leave no room for reasonable doubt .

1250
01:47:38,584 --> 01:47:40,794
But this trial isn 't about facts .

1251
01:47:41,753 --> 01:47:44,506
This trial is about possibilities .

1252
01:47:45,090 --> 01:47:47,801
Is it a fact that Emily was a hypersensitive

1253
01:47:48,010 --> 01:47:49,511
as Dr. Adani suggests ?

1254
01:47:49,720 --> 01:47:55,434
A person who 's more likely , by her very nature , to become possessed ?

1255
01:47:56,768 --> 01:48:00,647
I can 't say that , but the question is :

1256
01:48:01,356 --> 01:48:02,524
Is it possible ?

1257
01:48:04,735 --> 01:48:08,447
Is it a fact that Gambutrol anesthetized Emily 's brain

1258
01:48:08,655 --> 01:48:12,075
so that the exorcism ritual was rendered ineffective ?

1259
01:48:14,328 --> 01:48:16,121
I can 't be sure of that .

1260
01:48:18,540 --> 01:48:19,750
But is it possible ?

1261
01:48:21,460 --> 01:48:25,714
Is it a fact that Emily was beloved by God ?

1262
01:48:27,633 --> 01:48:31,303
And that after her exorcism , she chose to suffer till the end

1263
01:48:31,512 --> 01:48:34,389
so that we might believe in a more magical world ?

1264
01:48:34,598 --> 01:48:38,268
A world where the spiritual realm really exists ?

1265
01:48:38,977 --> 01:48:40,938
I can 't say that 's a fact .

1266
01:48:42,147 --> 01:48:43,774
But ask yourself :

1267
01:48:46,151 --> 01:48:47,402
Is it possible ?

1268
01:48:49,071 --> 01:48:51,156
It 's what Emily believed .

1269
01:48:51,365 --> 01:48:53,033
It 's what Father Moore believed .

1270
01:48:53,242 --> 01:48:57,871
And that sincere belief is what determined her choices and his .

1271
01:48:58,080 --> 01:49:01,792
Now , for the most important question :

1272
01:49:03,293 --> 01:49:05,963
Is Father Richard Moore guilty

1273
01:49:06,171 --> 01:49:09,883
beyond a reasonable doubt , of negligent homicide ?

1274
01:49:10,425 --> 01:49:15,305
Did he , in fact , neglect Emily 's needs in such a way

1275
01:49:15,514 --> 01:49:17,891
that her death is now on his hands ?

1276
01:49:18,100 --> 01:49:22,145
No ! That is not a fact .

1277
01:49:22,354 --> 01:49:25,065
It is not a fact that Emily was epileptic .

1278
01:49:25,274 --> 01:49:29,653
It is not a fact that she was psychotic .

1279
01:49:29,862 --> 01:49:31,321
Facts

1280
01:49:32,072 --> 01:49:35,325
leave no room for possibilities .

1281
01:49:36,785 --> 01:49:38,161
The only fact

1282
01:49:38,370 --> 01:49:43,417
the only thing I know beyond a doubt in this case

1283
01:49:43,625 --> 01:49:47,129
is that Father Moore loved Emily with his whole heart .

1284
01:49:47,546 --> 01:49:50,841
He did everything in his power to help her .

1285
01:49:51,049 --> 01:49:55,762
He has risked his very freedom so we could hear her story .

1286
01:50:02,769 --> 01:50:04,271
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury

1287
01:50:04,479 --> 01:50:07,816
in my job I sometimes have to defend bad men .

1288
01:50:09,234 --> 01:50:12,112
Father Richard Moore is not one of them .

1289
01:50:15,324 --> 01:50:17,201
Don 't send a good man to prison .

1290
01:50:17,409 --> 01:50:20,454
I 'm not asking that you believe everything that Father Moore believes .

1291
01:50:20,662 --> 01:50:24,082
I 'm simply asking that you believe in Father Moore .

1292
01:50:41,183 --> 01:50:43,227
Madam Foreman , has the jury reached a verdict ?

1293
01:50:43,560 --> 01:50:45,103
We have , Your Honor .

1294
01:50:57,241 --> 01:50:59,326
Please read the verdict out loud .

1295
01:51:03,956 --> 01:51:07,000
" In the case of The People v. Father Richard Moore

1296
01:51:07,209 --> 01:51:09,962
we , the jury , find the defendant

1297
01:51:10,170 --> 01:51:13,048
guilty of negligent homicide . "

1298
01:51:14,883 --> 01:51:17,302
The court thanks the jury for its service .

1299
01:51:18,595 --> 01:51:22,599
Sentencing for this case will be set for April 3rd .

1300
01:51:22,808 --> 01:51:24,935
Your Honor , if it pleases the court

1301
01:51:25,143 --> 01:51:27,312
Father Moore requested at the start of trial

1302
01:51:27,521 --> 01:51:30,274
that if found guilty , he would be sentenced immediately .

1303
01:51:30,482 --> 01:51:32,401
Yes , I recall that .

1304
01:51:32,609 --> 01:51:36,780
Does the prosecution have any objection to expedited sentencing ?

1305
01:51:37,823 --> 01:51:39,324
Very well .

1306
01:51:43,078 --> 01:51:46,081
Father Richard Moore , do you understand this sentence

1307
01:51:46,290 --> 01:51:48,917
which has been found against you ? - Yes , Your Honor .

1308
01:51:49,126 --> 01:51:51,461
And do you understand the gravity of this crime ?

1309
01:51:51,670 --> 01:51:56,133
That you may , under the law , be sentenced to a term of up to 10 years ?

1310
01:51:56,341 --> 01:51:57,634
Yes , I do .

1311
01:51:57,843 --> 01:51:59,720
Are there any statements you wish to make

1312
01:51:59,928 --> 01:52:01,513
before I impose this sentence ?

1313
01:52:01,722 --> 01:52:03,557
- No , Your Honor . - Very well .

1314
01:52:03,765 --> 01:52:05,851
Excuse me , Your Honor

1315
01:52:06,101 --> 01:52:08,437
but the jury would like to make a recommendation

1316
01:52:08,645 --> 01:52:10,480
regarding the sentence . - Objection .

1317
01:52:10,981 --> 01:52:12,441
Sit down , counselor .

1318
01:52:12,649 --> 01:52:16,153
It 's only a recommendation , and I would like to hear it .

1319
01:52:18,655 --> 01:52:21,158
We recommend a sentence of time served .

1320
01:52:31,293 --> 01:52:32,586
I 'll accept that .

1321
01:52:37,633 --> 01:52:39,134
You are guilty , Father Moore .

1322
01:52:40,427 --> 01:52:42,137
And you are free to go .

1323
01:52:43,514 --> 01:52:46,475
- This court is dismissed . - All rise .

1324
01:52:54,525 --> 01:52:55,817
Thank you .

1325
01:53:23,011 --> 01:53:25,806
Well , you shocked us all .

1326
01:53:26,390 --> 01:53:28,809
Everyone at the firm sees this as another victory .

1327
01:53:28,976 --> 01:53:31,019
The archdiocese is pleased .

1328
01:53:31,228 --> 01:53:34,106
They feel the trial has raised public interest in the Church .

1329
01:53:34,314 --> 01:53:36,024
Have you seen the news ?

1330
01:53:36,233 --> 01:53:38,777
There 's our priest , leaving the courthouse a free man

1331
01:53:38,986 --> 01:53:40,612
right next to you .

1332
01:53:40,988 --> 01:53:43,198
Just like James Van Hopper .

1333
01:53:45,075 --> 01:53:46,994
All right , I 'll say it . I was wrong .

1334
01:53:47,327 --> 01:53:48,662
But I 'm ready to make it right .

1335
01:53:49,329 --> 01:53:51,999
I 'm offering you a full partnership in the firm .

1336
01:53:55,711 --> 01:53:57,212
Keep it .

1337
01:54:21,653 --> 01:54:24,364
Will you be able to return to your parish ?

1338
01:54:27,743 --> 01:54:29,411
I can 't go back .

1339
01:54:29,870 --> 01:54:31,413
Not now .

1340
01:54:33,707 --> 01:54:35,584
Once you 've looked into the darkness

1341
01:54:36,877 --> 01:54:40,255
I think you carry it with you for the rest of your life .

1342
01:54:44,593 --> 01:54:46,094
What about you ?

1343
01:54:48,597 --> 01:54:51,225
I believe you 've seen the darkness too .

1344
01:54:54,895 --> 01:54:56,563
I don 't know .

1345
01:54:59,066 --> 01:55:01,318
I 'm not sure what I 've seen .

1346
01:55:10,369 --> 01:55:13,747
- Who chose the epitaph ? - I did .

1347
01:55:14,665 --> 01:55:18,544
It 's from the second chapter of Philippians , verse 12 .

1348
01:55:19,211 --> 01:55:22,589
Emily recited it to me the night before she died .

1349
01:56:59,895 --> 01:57:04,107
As Emily predicted . Her story has affected many people :

1350
01:57:04,191 --> 01:57:09,947
Emily 's gravesite has become an unofficial holy shrine which continues

1351
01:57:10,030 --> 01:57:13,242
to draw visitors from all over the world .

1352
01:57:13,325 --> 01:57:16,203
After the trial , father Moore went into seclusion ,

1353
01:57:16,286 --> 01:57:20,457
refusing to appeal his guilty conviction , and stating .

1354
01:57:20,541 --> 01:57:25,796
" This is a matter for God : worldly courts cannot pass any judgement on it . "

1355
01:57:26,171 --> 01:57:30,342
Erin Bruner shared her case files with an expert in medical research

1356
01:57:30,425 --> 01:57:34,596
and anthropology whose further research and published work

1357
01:57:34,680 --> 01:57:38,684
about the life and death of Emily Rose inspired this film .

